WEBVTT

00:00:27.244 --> 00:00:29.613
Ta-da! (GRUNTS)

00:00:29.843 --> 00:00:31.157
Ta-da! (GRUNTS)

00:00:31.391 --> 00:00:32.494
Ta-da!

00:00:32.569 --> 00:00:33.994
-Ta-da! Ta...
-Ta-da!

00:00:34.077 --> 00:00:35.078
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:00:35.161 --> 00:00:36.204
(YELLS)
(CRASHING)

00:00:36.329 --> 00:00:37.532
Ta-da! (CHUCKLES)

00:00:37.956 --> 00:00:38.999
Ta-da!

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.333
(MUMBLES IN MINIONESE)

00:01:32.052 --> 00:01:35.597
(MAN SPEAKING RUSSIAN
OVER LOUDSPEAKER)
（北极圈 最高机密实验室）

00:01:48.803 --> 00:01:52.047
-(LAUGHS)
-(GRUNTS)

00:01:52.072 --> 00:01:54.616
(SPEAKING RUSSIAN)

00:01:54.839 --> 00:01:56.159
(LAUGHS)

00:01:56.302 --> 00:01:57.553
(WHOOPING)

00:01:58.078 --> 00:01:59.120
(SPEAKING RUSSIAN)

00:02:01.998 --> 00:02:03.041
Huh?

00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:05.877
(BOTH SPEAKING RUSSIAN)

00:02:08.421 --> 00:02:09.839
(GASPS)

00:02:09.965 --> 00:02:11.341
(YELLS)
(GRUNTS)

00:02:20.141 --> 00:02:21.184
(YELPS)

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:22.268
(SPEAKING RUSSIAN)

00:02:23.269 --> 00:02:24.312
(ALL YELLING)

00:02:58.513 --> 00:02:59.556
(GROANING)

00:03:14.112 --> 00:03:15.196
(GROANS)

00:03:15.681 --> 00:03:18.483
SILAS: Three weeks,
and we're still no closer to crackingthis.
3周了 还是一点头绪都没有

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:21.546
Right, bring him in!
好吧 把他带过来

00:03:22.295 --> 00:03:23.388
Yes, sir.
是的 长官

00:03:47.552 --> 00:03:49.522
♪ This is the best party ever! ♪
这是有史以来最棒的生日派对

00:04:04.496 --> 00:04:05.580
♪ (CHUCKLES) Yeah! ♪

00:04:08.666 --> 00:04:10.502
♪ Ha! (BLOWS RASPBERRY) ♪

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.003
♪ (SQUEALS) ♪

00:04:16.549 --> 00:04:17.592
♪ (WAILS) ♪

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.845
Oh, no! A dragon is approaching!
有条龙正在逼近

00:04:23.079 --> 00:04:24.432
(GROANS)

00:04:24.646 --> 00:04:25.650
(ALL YELL)
(CHUCKLING)

00:04:26.231 --> 00:04:29.775
Fear not, for here come
the gallant knights to save us.
别怕 英勇的骑士要来救我们了

00:04:30.438 --> 00:04:31.523
KIDS: Yay!

00:04:35.401 --> 00:04:36.486
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:04:48.286 --> 00:04:50.996
No, no, no.
What do you mean she's not coming?
你说她不会来是什么意思？

00:04:51.212 --> 00:04:53.935
I have a backyard full
of these little girls
我后院一大群小女孩

00:04:54.134 --> 00:04:57.989
who are counting on a visit
from a fairy princess. (GROANS)
都指望着能看见仙女呢

00:04:58.073 --> 00:05:00.647
Hurts! (YELLS) Stop it!

00:05:04.996 --> 00:05:07.982
Listen! I don't want a refund,
I want the fairy princess.
我不要退款 我要的是仙女

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.897
Please, please, I'm begging you.
求你了 求你了 救人一命

00:05:11.646 --> 00:05:14.065
You know what?
I hope that you can sleep at night,
我咒你晚上睡不着觉

00:05:14.124 --> 00:05:16.442
you crusher of little girls' dreams!
因为你粉碎了小女孩的梦想

00:05:17.094 --> 00:05:19.250
AGNES: Ooh, ooh!
When's the fairy princess coming?
仙女什么时候来？

00:05:20.363 --> 00:05:21.718
Any minute now!
马上就来

00:05:22.045 --> 00:05:23.992
Yay!

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:25.718
Stall them!
拖住她们

00:05:25.743 --> 00:05:26.995
(GRUNTS)
(CHATTERS IN MINIONESE)

00:05:29.956 --> 00:05:30.999
KIDS: Ooh!

